# WS1-01. Source: spec/grammar.ebnf.md §10.6 escape_seq (n r t 0 \ " ' and \x
# with two hex digits) and spec/01-lexical.md §9 LEX-20 (a char literal is a u8
# byte); byte values from ASCII.
expect: output
contrast: '\x41' ==> '\x42'
contrast-expect: output
--- output
10 13 9 0 92 39 34 65 127 255
--- contrast-output
10 13 9 0 92 39 34 66 127 255
